              "text": "स्वाभिमान — svābhimān — \"self-respect\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गरीब असला तरी त्याने स्वाभिमान सोडला नाही. garīb aslā tarī tyāne svābhimān soḍlā nāhī. Though he was poor, he never gave up his self-respect."
